/senior/sponsor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-spore-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"spore","sort_order":1,"sense":"孢子","alt_zh":"高中生在自然館觀察蕨葉背面孢子囊與放大的單顆孢子教具，無培養步驟。","example":"The enlarged model showed a fern releasing a spore.","example_zh":"放大模型展示蕨類釋放一顆孢子。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/spore-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stagger-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stagger","sort_order":1,"sense":"搖晃；踉蹌","alt_zh":"成年戲劇老師指導穿完整戲服的高中演員在低平舞臺安全演出踉蹌動作，無傷害。","example":"The tired actor pretended to stagger across the stage.","example_zh":"疲倦的演員在舞臺上假裝步履搖晃。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stagger-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stagnation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stagnation","sort_order":1,"sense":"停滯","alt_zh":"高中團隊看著長期未改變的未完成模型，老師帶來新的圖卡準備引導。","example":"The lack of new ideas led to stagnation in the project.","example_zh":"缺乏新想法，使專案停滯。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stagnation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stakeholder-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stakeholder","sort_order":1,"sense":"利害關係人","alt_zh":"成年居民、店家、老師與高中學生代表平等圍桌討論花園模型。","example":"Each stakeholder could comment on the proposed community garden.","example_zh":"每位利害關係人都能對社區花園提案發表意見。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stakeholder-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stamina-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stamina","sort_order":1,"sense":"耐力","alt_zh":"高中樂團在成年指揮帶領下專注排練，旁邊有水壺與休息椅，無過度疲勞傷害。","example":"The long rehearsal tested the musicians' stamina.","example_zh":"長時間排練考驗樂手耐力。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stamina-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-standstill-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"standstill","sort_order":1,"sense":"停頓","alt_zh":"安全市區道路工程前車輛有序停住，成年交通人員在前方指引，無事故。","example":"The roadworks brought traffic to a standstill.","example_zh":"道路工程使交通完全停頓。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/standstill-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-starvation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"starvation","sort_order":1,"sense":"飢餓","alt_zh":"成年救援志工與高中志工在社區中心有尊嚴地發送充足糧食，無消瘦痛苦特寫。","example":"The relief program aimed to prevent starvation after the crop failure.","example_zh":"救援計畫致力防止歉收後發生飢餓。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/starvation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-statesman-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"statesman","sort_order":1,"sense":"政治家","alt_zh":"虛構成年資深政治家在會議桌引導不同代表冷靜交談，無真實人物黨徽。","example":"The respected statesman encouraged peaceful negotiations.","example_zh":"受敬重的政治家鼓勵和平談判。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/statesman-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stationary-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stationary","sort_order":1,"sense":"靜止的","alt_zh":"高中生與老師在工坊將推車車輪固定穩妥，以量尺測量高度，無數字。","example":"The cart remained stationary while we measured its height.","example_zh":"我們測量推車高度時，推車保持靜止。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stationary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stature-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stature","sort_order":1,"se