","version":1},{"id":"senior-stipend-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stipend","sort_order":1,"sense":"津貼","alt_zh":"成年研究生在大學辦公室接過津貼文件，桌上有車票與研究筆記，無金額。","example":"The research stipend helped cover her travel expenses.","example_zh":"研究津貼協助支付她的交通開銷。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stipend-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-strait-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"strait","sort_order":1,"sense":"海峽","alt_zh":"高中生在地理教室觀察兩座大型島嶼之間狹窄海水通道的立體模型，無文字。","example":"The strait separated the two large islands.","example_zh":"海峽分隔兩座大島。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/strait-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-strand-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"strand","sort_order":1,"sense":"一股；一縷","alt_zh":"高中手作課桌上清楚可見一條細藍線放在素色布面，成年老師指示觀察。","example":"A single strand of blue thread lay across the cloth.","example_zh":"布面上橫放著一股藍線。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/strand-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stratum-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stratum","sort_order":1,"sense":"地層","alt_zh":"成年地質老師與高中生在安全有護欄觀景區觀看清楚多層岩壁，指向其中一層。","example":"The geologist examined one stratum of the exposed rock.","example_zh":"地質學家檢查裸露岩壁中的一層地層。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stratum-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-strenuous-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"strenuous","sort_order":1,"sense":"費力的","alt_zh":"成年嚮導與高中生完成安全陡坡步道後在有護欄涼亭休息、喝水，裝備完整。","example":"The strenuous climb left the hikers ready for a rest.","example_zh":"費力攀登後，健行者需要休息。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/strenuous-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stricture-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stricture","sort_order":1,"sense":"限制","alt_zh":"高中團隊與老師調整花園模型，讓公共步道保持寬敞暢通。","example":"The design had to meet a stricture against blocking the public path.","example_zh":"設計必須遵守不得阻擋公共步道的限制。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stricture-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stride-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stride","sort_order":1,"sense":"大步","alt_zh":"成年女工程師拿著模型盒，以穩健大步走過明亮展覽大廳，衣著合宜。","example":"She crossed the hall with a confident stride.","example_zh":"她邁著自信大步穿過大廳。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stride-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stronghold-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stronghold","sort_order":1,"sense":"據點","alt_zh":"高中參訪團從安全遠處觀景臺欣賞山丘頂堅固歷史城堡，無戰鬥。","example":"The old castle served as a stronghold above the valley.","example_zh":"古堡曾是山谷上方的防守據點。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stronghold-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-structure-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"structure","sort_order":1,"sense":"結構","alt_zh":"高中生與成年老師觀察透明剖面橋梁模型，支架與梁柱清楚。","example":"The model revealed the bridge's internal structure.","example_zh":"模型顯示橋梁內部結構。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/structure-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-stumble-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"stumble","sort_order":1,"sense":"絆倒","alt_zh":"成年健行者在低平安全步道略失平衡、穩穩抓住扶手，成年嚮導在旁，無受傷。","example":"He began to stumble on the uneven path but caught the handrail.","example_zh":"他在不平步道絆了一下，但抓住扶手。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/stumble-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subdue-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subdue","sort_order":1,"sense":"制伏；抑制；平復","alt_zh":"高中合唱團在後臺聽輕柔音樂、慢慢放鬆神情，成年老師陪伴。","example":"The gentle music helped subdue the group's nervousness.","example_zh":"柔和音樂有助平復大家的緊張。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subdue-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-sublime-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"sublime","sort_order":1,"sense":"崇高的；壯麗的","alt_zh":"成年嚮導與高中生從堅固觀景臺讚嘆廣闊雪峰、雲海與晨光。","example":"The sublime mountain scenery left the visitors speechless.","example_zh":"崇高壯麗的山景讓訪客說不出話。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/sublime-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-submarine-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"submarine","sort_order":1,"sense":"潛水艇","alt_zh":"海洋博物館大型模型展示民用研究潛水艇照亮深海魚群，無武器。","example":"The research submarine explored the deep sea.","example_zh":"研究潛水艇探索深海。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/submarine-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-submerge-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"submerge","sort_order":1,"sense":"沈沒；浸入","alt_zh":"高中生在成年老師旁把小塑膠船教具輕輕壓入透明低水位水盤，安全整潔。","example":"We could submerge the small model boat in the clear tank.","example_zh":"我們可以把小模型船浸入透明水槽。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/submerge-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subscribe-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subscribe","sort_order":1,"sense":"訂閱","alt_zh":"成年圖書館員與高中生查看新科學雜誌樣本並填寫無可讀文字的訂閱文件。","example":"The library decided to subscribe to a new science magazine.","example_zh":"圖書館決定訂閱新科學雜誌。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subscribe-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subsequent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subsequent","sort_order":1,"sense":"隨後的","alt_zh":"高中團隊在改良後穩固模型橋旁欣喜，桌上有第一次失敗測試的照片，單一場景。","example":"The first test failed, but the subsequent test was successful.","example_zh":"第一次測試失敗，但隨後的測試成功。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subsequent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subsidiary-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subsidiary","sort_order":1,"sense":"子公司","alt_zh":"成年企業代表在會議室查看母公司連接海外小工坊的立體組織模型，無文字。","example":"The company opened a subsidiary to manage its overseas workshops.","example_zh":"公司設立子公司，管理海外工坊。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subsidiary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-subsistence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"subsistence","sort_order":1,"sense":"生存","alt_zh":"成年村民在小農田收穫日常糧食、整齊裝籃，高中訪客尊重參觀。","example":"The village grew enough crops for basic subsistence.","example_zh":"村莊種植足以維持基本生活的作物。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/subsistence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-substantiate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"substantiate","sort_order":1,"sense":"證實","alt_zh":"成年歷史學家與高中生仔細比較老照片、古橋模型與檔案，無可讀文字。","example":"The photographs helped substantiate the historian's account.","example_zh":"照片幫助證實歷史學家的敘述。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/substantiate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"ge